Portfolio of Aalaaïddine Ali Mlinde — a little party platformer built with PixiJS.
Live at https://alaidine.github.io/portfolio/

Desktop with a keyboard gets the game; phones, tablets and small windows get a plain page
with the same content. Links like /#contact always open the page.

Files:
    index.html   page content (About / Projects / Contact), also used for the in-game signs
    main.js      picks game or page, page mascot
    game.js      the game (level, movement, rendering)
    sprites.js   pixel art shared by both
    arcade/      the earlier arcade-style version

Run locally (ES modules need a server, opening index.html directly won't work):

    npx http-server -p 8080 -c-1

then open http://localhost:8080

Pushing to main deploys to GitHub Pages (.github/workflows/static.yml).
